/E (Being part of the WHO committee comes with its own set of challenges, including navigating diverse perspectives and aligning national interests with global responsibilities. However, the growth, confidence, and insight gained through this process are truly unmatched. We hope you make the most of this experience: take initiative, ask questions, challenge ideas respectfully, and enjoy the journey)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
